 "notes": "ELO: from eloratings.net current World ranking (World.tsv); all 48 qualified teams matched (Czechia=Czech Republic, Curacao=Curaçao, USA=United States in their dict). High confidence. TITLE ODDS: decimal values are BetMGM (1 Jun 2026, all 48 teams). Cross-checks from FanDuel (2 Jun) and DraftKings (5 Jun) stored under title_odds_alt; favorites agree closely (Spain/France ~+450/+500, England ~+650, Arg/Bra ~+800-950, Por ~+900-1000). Lines move daily. De-vig not applied here (raw decimal provided as requested); BetMGM overround across 48 is large (~140-150%+) typical for outrights. MATCH ODDS: 24 first-round matches (Jun 11-17) = the complete first round of all 12 groups (each group's first two fixtures). Source Dimers, which surfaces DraftKings/theScore/BetRivers lines alongside its own model; American odds converted to decimal. Home/away orientation follows the fixture's designated home team. NOTE: some lopsided ties used a different totals line than 2.5 — recorded as total_line: Germany-Curacao 4.5, Spain-CapeVerde 3.5, Norway-Iraq 3.5, Austria-Jordan 3.5, Ecuador-IvoryCoast 1.5. USA-Paraguay: Dimers page titled 'Paraguay vs United States' (venue) but USA is FIFA-designated home; recorded home=USA at -100. MODEL PROBS: Opta supercomputer (10,000 sims). Title% complete for top ~26; reach_final only published for 4 teams, reach_semi for 4 others, win_group for 5 — gaps are because the article only highlighted those; not all teams disclosed. Dimers per-match win probs also captured per match (see data/raw notes). FIFA RANK: top-18 points are official 1 Apr 2026; teams ranked ~19-50 and the sub-50 qualifiers are ~10 Jun 2026 projected/search values (official June update lands 10 Jun, after today). Treat FIFA points as Medium confidence on exact decimals, High on ordering. Confidence overall: High for Elo(all48) and title-odds favorites; Med for full match-odds set and FIFA point decimals."
